Package: godesk-client
Version: __VERSION__
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Nathan Quadros <nathanq_@hotmail.com>
Recommends: php-yaml
Homepage: https://github.com/nathanqweq/goDesk
Description: goDesk Client - modulo Zabbix + sincronizacao de config
 Instala o modulo frontend do Zabbix (edicao/visualizacao do
 godesk-config.yaml) e o binario godesk-client, que valida esse YAML e
 o envia para o servidor goDesk (godesk serve) sempre que o admin salva
 pela UI. Use este pacote no host que roda o frontend do Zabbix; use o
 pacote "godesk" no host que roda o godesk serve/alertscripts.
